## 2. How to run

From the repo root, against UI `:3100` and API `:8787`:

```bash
npx playwright test --grep-invert @live --workers=3
npx playwright test --grep @live --workers=1
```

`@live` needs the Zetaris lock and `--workers=1`. Do not remove a lock this lane does not hold.

